    "tactics": "Dust Devils harass and distract. They position to use Sand Scatter on spellcasters or archers, then slip away before retaliation. A Friendly Dust Devil takes these instructions naturally; an Indifferent one drifts toward whoever seems most interesting.",
    "attacksNotes": "<p>Buffet [Combat]: Melee attack (Agil 6 + Melee Combat 1), Reach: 5 ft</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Margin 1:</strong>: 5 damage (3 + 2 Str)</li>\n<li><strong>Margin 2:</strong> 5 damage, DR halved (round up)</li>\n</ul>",
    "specialAbilitiesNotes": "<p>Whirlwind Form: The Dust Devil can pass through spaces as narrow as 1 inch without squeezing. Creatures attempting to grab or grapple it add 1 to both dice. Sand Scatter: Once per turn as a [Free] action, the Dust Devil can kick up grit and debris in a 5-foot diameter. Creatures in range make a Reflex [Easy] save or gain the Dazzled condition until the start of their next turn.</p>",
